{"4280790": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Down Below", "steam_appid": 4280790, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Down Below</strong> casts you into the mysterious world of the Below. As a lone traveler, you race toward the fabled city of Agorapolis while the creeping force known as the Oblivion follows your every step.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chapter One </strong>(free demo) is the prologue to the game, introducing the story and the first cast of characters who will follow you <strong>toward</strong> the fabled city, whether helping you or otherwise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Narrative-driven - Meaningful dialogue, memorable characters, and discoverable lore shape your journey.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Hybrid gameplay - top-down pixel exploration paired with sudden arena combat encounters and boss battles.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Compact demo experience - Chapter One plays for about 45 - 60 minutes when fully explored and is free to try.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Full game in development – Additional chapters, controller support, and more platforms are planned for the full release.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• A goose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PLATFORM &amp; CONTROLS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Current: Windows (keyboard &amp; mouse).  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Planned: Linux and macOS, plus controller support in the near future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ABOUT THE DEVELOPER</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed by a solo creator under the name <strong>ThePingoose</strong>. Originally started in Unreal Engine 5, the project was rebuilt in GDevelop to create a focused, story-driven pixel adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play Chapter One free on Windows and begin your journey toward Agorapolis.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Down Below</strong> casts you into the mysterious world of the Below. As a lone traveler, you race toward the fabled city of Agorapolis while the creeping force known as the Oblivion follows your every step.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chapter One </strong>(free demo) is the prologue to the game, introducing the story and the first cast of characters who will follow you <strong>toward</strong> the fabled city, whether helping you or otherwise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Narrative-driven - Meaningful dialogue, memorable characters, and discoverable lore shape your journey.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Hybrid gameplay - top-down pixel exploration paired with sudden arena combat encounters and boss battles.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Compact demo experience - Chapter One plays for about 45 - 60 minutes when fully explored and is free to try.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Full game in development – Additional chapters, controller support, and more platforms are planned for the full release.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• A goose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PLATFORM &amp; CONTROLS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Current: Windows (keyboard &amp; mouse).  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Planned: Linux and macOS, plus controller support in the near future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ABOUT THE DEVELOPER</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed by a solo creator under the name <strong>ThePingoose</strong>. Originally started in Unreal Engine 5, the project was rebuilt in GDevelop to create a focused, story-driven pixel adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play Chapter One free on Windows and begin your journey toward Agorapolis.</strong></p>", "short_description": "In this top-down pixel art adventure, you wake up in a dark hallway, unaware of your surroundings. The only person